<script setup lang="ts">import type {Run} from '../types/domain';import {dec} from '../utils/format';import Table from './common/Table.vue';defineProps<{run:Run}>()</script><template><section class="alignment-grid"><div class="section-title"><h2>独立重拟合，再做主题匹配。</h2><small>参照是预定第0次，均值排除参照自身</small></div><Table :headers="['重复 / seed','迭代数','相对重建误差','匹配到参照的原主题编号',...Array.from({length:run.config.k},(_,i)=>'主题'+(i+1)+'余弦')]"><tr v-for="rep in run.result.replicates" :key="rep.index"><td><strong>{{rep.index===0?'参照 / 0':'重复 / '+rep.index}}</strong><small>seed {{rep.seed}}</small></td><td>{{rep.iterations}}</td><td>{{dec(rep.relative_error)}}</td><td class="mono">{{rep.alignment.permutation.map(x=>x+1).join(' → ')}}</td><td v-for="(sim,i) in rep.alignment.similarities" :key="i"><span class="similarity" :style="{opacity:.4+sim*.6}">{{dec(sim)}}</span></td></tr></Table><p>每次独立random初始化并重拟合，H先L1归一、W同步乘尺度保持WH；余弦相似矩阵经Hungarian一对一最大匹配。稳定是对初始化的敏感性，不是语义真值。</p></section></template>
